      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px;">
      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">Conversations with loved ones</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">Harder to follow, more tiring, and requiring repeated words in group settings.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">Meetings and phone calls</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">Missed words and repeated questions leading to professional strain and auditory fatigue.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">Watching TV</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">Turning the volume up excessively high and still missing speech clarity and consonant definition.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">Social life</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">Many people withdraw from social gatherings and family dawat, which reduces confidence and quality of life.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

